WEBVTT

00:04:27.167 --> 00:04:30.893
Could be corrugated metal,
a fabric or plastic.

00:04:30.917 --> 00:04:34.559
And these materials
come together and aggregate.

00:04:34.583 --> 00:04:36.351
It's like a kit of parts.

00:04:36.375 --> 00:04:39.934
And it's used all the way
from a small tent,

00:04:39.958 --> 00:04:42.976
which might house
five or six people, or a family,

00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:46.851
to temples that can house 500,
sometimes 1,000 people.

00:04:46.875 --> 00:04:50.643
And this kit of parts,
and this imagination of the city,

00:04:50.667 --> 00:04:53.809
allows it to be disassembled.

00:04:53.833 --> 00:04:56.434
And so at the end
of the festival, within a week,

00:04:56.458 --> 00:04:58.601
the entire city is disassembled.

00:04:58.625 --> 00:05:01.184
These are again images from the same spot.